# Custom challenge objective translations (objectives without Rockstar label IDs).
Beat Blackjack dealers in Rhodes and Van Horn.=在羅德和范霍恩擊敗二十一點莊家。
Beat the Five Finger Fillet player in Strawberry, Valentine and Van Horn.=在草莓鎮、瓦倫丁和范霍恩擊敗「五指刀」玩家。
Bust a Poker opponent at Flatneck, Saint Denis and Valentine.=在弗萊特奈克、聖丹尼斯和瓦倫丁的撲克遊戲中淘汰一名對手。
Catch a Bayou fish from a riverboat and another while on train tracks.=從河船上釣到一條沼澤魚，並在鐵軌上再釣到一條。
Catch one of every type of fish.=每種魚都捕獲一條。
Double down and win 5 Blackjack hands.=在二十一點中加倍下注並贏得 5 局。
Drag a victim 3,300 feet with your lasso while mounted.=騎馬時用套索拖行受害者 3,300 英尺。
Hit a target from at least 660 feet with a long-scoped rifle.=使用長瞄準鏡步槍擊中至少 660 英尺外的目標。
Kill 15 enemies with a long-barrelled shotgun.=使用長槍管霰彈槍擊殺 15 名敵人。
Kill 2 animal species in one Dead Eye use.=在一次死亡之眼中擊殺 2 種動物。
Kill 5 scavengers while they feed on corpses.=在食腐動物啃食屍體時將其擊殺，共 5 隻。
Pick and eat 4 different berry species.=採集並食用 4 種不同的漿果。
Pick one of every herb species.=每種草藥各採集一株。
Win 3 Blackjack hands with at least 3 hits each.=贏得 3 局二十一點，每局至少要再要牌 3 次。
